# Warhost's Frenzy's delayed "whenever a creature you control dies this turn" is a leaves-the-battlefield ability: it looks
# back to the board as it was before the event (CR 603.10a), so a creature dying at the same time as Hushbringer,
# Hushbringer included, doesn't cause it to trigger (Hushbringer's rulings). Bot1 casts Ornithopter and Hushbringer on
# turn 1 and, on turn 3, a kicked Warhost's Frenzy, then Pyroclasm: Hushbringer and the Ornithopter die together and Bot1
# draws nothing, its hand empty.

